hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15645","Waki ibn al-Jarrah and Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi narrated to us, from Sufyan, from Abu Hazim, from Sahl ibn Sad al-Saidi, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: A morning going or an evening going in the path of Allah, Mighty and Majestic, is better than the world and what is in it."
"15646","He said: Bishr ibn al-Mufaddal narrated to us, he said: Abu Hazim narrated to us, from Sahl ibn Sad, he said: I saw the men taking midday rest and eating lunch on Friday."
"15647","Waki narrated to us, from Sufyan, from Abu Hazim, from Sahl ibn Sad, he said: I saw the men tying their waist wrappers in their necks like children, from the narrowness of the wrappers, behind the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, in prayer. So one saying said: O company of women, do not raise your heads until the men raise."
"15648","Abu Kamil al-Jahdari Fudayl ibn Husayn dictated to me from his original book, he said: Umar ibn Ali narrated to us, he said: Abu Hazim narrated to us, he said: I heard Sahl ibn Sad al-Saidi saying: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: A morning going in the path of Allah or an evening going is better than the world and what is in it, and the place of the whip of one of you in Paradise is better than the world and what is in it."
"15649","He said: Sufyan ibn Uyaynah narrated to us, from Abu Hazim, from Sahl ibn Sad, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: The place of a whip in Paradise is better than the world and what is in it."
"15650","Abdullah narrated to us, he said: Al-Layth ibn Khalid al-Balkhi Abu Bakr narrated to me, he said: Umar ibn Ali narrated to us, from Abu Hazim, from Sahl ibn Sad, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: A morning going or an evening going in the path of Allah is better than the world and what is in it."
"15651","Abdullah narrated to us, Abu Bishr Asim ibn Umar ibn Ali al-Muqaddami narrated to us, he said: My father narrated to us, from Abu Hazim al-Madani, from Sahl ibn Sad al-Saidi, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: A morning going or an evening going in the path of Allah is better than the world and what is in it, and the place of the whip of one of you in Paradise is better than the world and what is in it."
"15652","Abdullah narrated to us, he said: Suwayd ibn Said and Abu Ibrahim al-Tarjuman narrated to me, they said: Abd al-Aziz ibn Abi Hazim narrated to us, from his father, from Sahl ibn Sad, he said: I heard the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, saying: The place of a whip in Paradise is better than the world and what is in it, and a morning going that a servant goes in the path of Allah is better than the world and what is in it."
"15653","Abdullah: Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr al-Muqaddami narrated to me, he said: Fudayl ibn Sulayman al-Numayri narrated to us, from Abu Hazim, from Sahl ibn Sad, from the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, he said: A morning going or an evening going in the path of Allah is better than the world and what is in it."
"15654","Yunus ibn Muhammad narrated to us, he said: Al-Attaf ibn Khalid narrated to us, Abu Hazim narrated to us, he said: I heard Sahl ibn Sad, he said: I heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, saying: A morning going in the path of Allah is better than the world and what is in it, and an evening going in the path of Allah is better than the world and what is in it, and the place of a whip in Paradise is better than the world and what is in it."
"15655","Husayn ibn Muhammad narrated to us, he said: Muhammad ibn Mutarrif, and he is Abu Ghassan, narrated to us, from Abu Hazim, from Sahl ibn Sad, that he heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, saying: An evening going in the path of Allah is better than the world and what is in it, then he mentioned its meaning."
"15656","He said: Isam ibn Khalid and Abu al-Nadr narrated to us, they said: Al-Attaf ibn Khalid narrated to us, from Abu Hazim, from Sahl ibn Sad al-Saidi, he said: I heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, saying: A battle in the path of Allah is better than the world and what is in it, and an evening going in the path of Allah is better than the world and what is in it, and the place of a whip in Paradise is better than the world and what is in it."
"15657","Abdullah narrated to us, he said: Jafar ibn Abi Hurayrah dictated to me from his book, he said: Said ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Jumahi narrated to us, from Abu Hazim, from Sahl ibn Sad, that the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: The place of a whip in Paradise is better than the world and what is in it."
